{{Term/Store|Diamond Circlet|Diamond Circlets|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Diamond Circlets are a type of [[Circlet]] [[Accessory]] that serve as head [[Armor]].<ref name="CaC 196"/> One can be found inside a [[Treasure Chest]] located in a chamber under the [[Lomei Labyrinth Island]]. Once obtained, all of the [[Decayed Guardian]]s inside the chamber will activate. [[Link]] can also purchase Diamond Circlets in the [[Starlight Memories]] [[Jewelry Shop]] at [[Gerudo Town]] for 1,500 [[Rupee]]s and three [[Diamond]]s.<ref name="BotW Isha"/> When worn, Diamond Circlets provide one level of [[Guardian Resist Up]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They also provide the hidden [[Added Effect]] [[Ancient Pow Up]], increasing damage done by [[Ancient Soldier Gear]] and [[Guardian Gear]] by 20%.

Diamond Circlets can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. However, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

