==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Diamond Circlet is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and it is obtained by completing the [[Challenge]] "[[Hunting for Gemstones]]". Unlike most other pieces of Attire, it cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].
